gmlshare writes what the engine shares with the stylesheets and gml.tex
(lib/shared.ml): as XML (the default, gmlshare xml), kept as
xslt/gml-shared.xml, and as TeX (gmlshare tex), kept as
share/tex/gml-shared.tex.

  $ alias gmlshare=../../bin/gmlshare.exe
  $ gmlshare -o shared.xml
  $ gmlshare xml | cmp - shared.xml && echo xml is the default
  xml is the default
  $ head -3 shared.xml
  <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
  <!-- generated by gmlshare from lib/; do not edit -->
  <shared xmlns="urn:x-gml:shared" canonical="urn:x-gml:canonical" root="doc">

The state hints (xslt/scope.xsl) and the properties they set:

  $ grep 'class="state"' shared.xml | sed 's/.*name="\([^"]*\)".*sets="\([^"]*\)".*/\1: \2/' | paste -s -d ' ' -
  bc: bc bf: font es: es fo: fill align overdraw hy: hy in: in of ir: ir ju: fill align overdraw ll: ll ls: ls nf: fill align overdraw of: of pf: font sb: sb tb: tb tp: tp ud: ud ws: ws wz: wz
  $ grep 'conditional=' shared.xml | sed 's/.*name="\([^"]*\)".*/\1/' | paste -s -d ' ' -
  hy in ir

The properties, in scope.xsl's order:

  $ grep '<property' shared.xml | sed 's/.*name="\([^"]*\)" tier="\([^"]*\)" initial="\([^"]*\)".*/\2 \1=\3/'
  block in=0
  block ir=0
  block of=0
  block ll=default
  block fill=yes
  block align=justify
  block overdraw=extend
  block tp=default
  block tb=default
  block ls=default
  block wz=default
  block bc=default
  inline font=initial
  inline hy=off
  inline ws=default
  inline es=default
  inline sb=default
  inline ud=default

Every word of the hint table is a registered control word:

  $ awk '/<word .*grammar=/ { n++; if (!/supported="yes"/) print "not registered:", $2 } END { print n, "rows" }' shared.xml
  88 rows

The name encoding of the coupling files (Aux.tex_name, Aux.enc):

  $ grep -e 'plain="fig-1"' -e 'plain="a+b"' -e 'plain="caf' -e 'plain="x' -e '<symbol' shared.xml
     <vector plain="fig-1" tex="fig-1" enc="fig#2D1"/>
     <vector plain="a+b" tex="a+43+b" enc="a#2B43#2Bb"/>
     <vector plain="café" tex="caf+233+" enc="caf#2B233#2B"/>
     <vector plain="x𝔸" tex="x+120120+" enc="x#2B120120#2B"/>
     <symbol role="query" plain="q1.12.3" value="pq@1@12@3"/>
     <symbol role="anchor" plain="gml.tc.1" value="pa@gml@tc@1"/>
     <symbol role="anchor" plain="fig-1" value="pa@fig#2D1"/>

The TeX declarations of the same values, read by gml.tex
(share/tex/gml-shared.tex; test/tex_shared.t runs gml.tex with them):
the units with their sizes, the aux file's first line and prefixes:

  $ gmlshare tex -o shared.tex
  $ head -1 shared.tex
  % generated by gmlshare from lib/; do not edit
  $ grep -e '^\\gml@unit' -e '^\\def' -e '^\\gml@auxprefix' shared.tex
  \gml@unitrel{ch}% figure space of the initial font
  \gml@unitrel{line}% line spacing of the current font
  \gml@unitkw{cm}{cm}% 50/127 inch
  \gml@unitkw{mm}{mm}% 5/127 inch
  \gml@unitkw{i}{in}% 1 inch
  \gml@unitrel{mh}% em-space of the current font
  \gml@unitrel{mv}% em-height of the current font
  \gml@unitsp{dh}{19734}{5280}% device unit, 1/240 inch
  \gml@unitsp{dv}{19734}{5280}% device unit, 1/240 inch
  \gml@unitkw{pt}{bp}% 1/72 inch
  \gml@unitsp{dd}{70097}{435}% 37/2500 inch
  \gml@unitsfx{cm}{cm}
  \gml@unitsfx{mm}{mm}
  \gml@unitsfx{i}{i}
  \gml@unitsfx{mh}{mh}
  \gml@unitsfx{m}{mh}
  \gml@unitsfx{mv}{mv}
  \gml@unitsfx{dh}{dh}
  \gml@unitsfx{dv}{dv}
  \gml@unitcpd{p}{pt}
  \gml@unitcpd{c}{dd}
  \def\gml@auxheader{.* gml aux}
  \gml@auxprefix{anchor}{pa@}
  \gml@auxprefix{query}{pq@}
  \gml@auxprefix{pageref}{pr@}
  \gml@auxprefix{tagset}{px@}

and a hint for every node of kind hint:

  $ grep '^\\gml@enginehint' shared.tex | sed 's/.*{\(.*\)}/\1/' > tex-hints
  $ grep 'kind="hint"' shared.xml | sed 's/.*name="\([^"]*\)".*/\1/' | cmp - tex-hints && echo same hints
  same hints
